# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"PDF Arranger merges, splits, rearranges, rotates and crops PDF documents. "
"Everything happens in memory against the pages you can see; nothing is "
"written until you save."
msgstr ""
"PDF Arranger spaja, dijeli, preslaguje, okreće i obrezuje PDF dokumente. Sve"
" se događa u memoriji, na stranicama koje vidiš; ništa se ne zapisuje dok ne"
" spremiš."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"It is a front end for pikepdf. Page content is never rewritten — only page "
"order, geometry and composition."
msgstr ""
"To je sučelje nad pikepdf-om. Sadržaj stranica nikada se ne prepisuje — samo"
" redoslijed stranica, geometrija i sastav."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Naredbeni redak"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Files given on the command line are opened as one document. "
"<code>--version</code> prints the version and exits."
msgstr ""
"Datoteke navedene u naredbenom retku otvaraju se kao jedan dokument. "
"<code>--version</code> ispisuje inačicu i završava."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py pdfarranger_qt/mainwindow.py
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "Čitanje"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The application opens in <b>read mode</b>: a continuous page view for "
"reading the document rather than rearranging it. <b>View ▸ Arrange Mode</b> "
"(Ctrl+E) swaps to the thumbnail grid and back."
msgstr ""
"Program se otvara u <b>načinu čitanja</b>: neprekinutom prikazu stranica za "
"čitanje dokumenta, a ne za njegovo preslagivanje. <b>Prikaz ▸ Način "
"slaganja</b> (Ctrl+E) prebacuje na mrežu sličica i natrag."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Reading shows the document <i>as edited</i>: rotations, crops, deletions and"
" reordering are all applied, so what you read is what you would get if you "
"saved. Page-editing commands are disabled while reading — bookmarks are the "
"exception, and are edited here and nowhere else."
msgstr ""
"Čitanje prikazuje dokument <i>onakav kakav je uređen</i>: okretanja, "
"obrezivanja, brisanja i preslagivanja sve su primijenjeni, pa je ono što "
"čitaš ono što bi dobio da si spremio. Naredbe za uređivanje stranica "
"isključene su tijekom čitanja — zabilješke su iznimka i uređuju se ovdje i "
"nigdje drugdje."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The page you are on follows you between the two modes. Switching to read "
"mode opens at the page selected in the grid, the first of them if several "
"are selected; switching back scrolls the grid to the page you were reading, "
"without disturbing what you had selected. With nothing selected, reading "
"resumes where you left off — your place in each document is remembered "
"between visits."
msgstr ""
"Stranica na kojoj si prati te između dvaju načina. Prelazak u način čitanja "
"otvara stranicu odabranu u mreži, prvu od njih ako ih je odabrano više; "
"povratak pomiče mrežu na stranicu koju si čitao, ne dirajući ono što si bio "
"odabrao. Bez odabira čitanje se nastavlja ondje gdje si stao — tvoje mjesto "
"u svakom dokumentu pamti se između posjeta."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The toolbar shows which page you are on and how many there are; type a "
"number into it to jump there, or use <b>Ctrl+G</b>."
msgstr ""
"Alatna traka pokazuje na kojoj si stranici i koliko ih ima; upiši u nju broj"
" da skočiš onamo ili upotrijebi <b>Ctrl+G</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>View ▸ Continuous Scroll</b> is on by default; turning it off shows one "
"page at a time. <b>View ▸ Facing Pages</b> puts two pages side by side, the "
"way a book falls open. Both settings are remembered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Prikaz ▸ Neprekinuto pomicanje</b> zadano je uključeno; isključivanjem se"
" prikazuje jedna stranica odjednom. <b>Prikaz ▸ Dvostruka stranica</b> "
"stavlja dvije stranice jednu uz drugu, onako kako se knjiga otvara. Obje "
"postavke se pamte."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around a document"
msgstr "Kretanje po dokumentu"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"One rule for the arrow keys: <b>the modifier decides what moves</b>. Nothing"
" scrolls the view, Option (Alt) moves the text cursor, Shift extends the "
"selection, Command (Ctrl) jumps to an edge, and Fn — Page Up, Page Down, "
"Home and End — jumps further. None of it changes according to whether a text"
" cursor happens to be on the page."
msgstr ""
"Jedno pravilo za tipke sa strelicama: <b>modifikator odlučuje što se "
"pomiče</b>. Nijedan pomiče prikaz, Option (Alt) pomiče tekstni pokazivač, "
"Shift proširuje odabir, Command (Ctrl) skače na rub, a Fn — Page Up, Page "
"Down, Home i End — skače dalje. Ništa se od toga ne mijenja ovisno o tome je"
" li na stranici slučajno tekstni pokazivač."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Keys"
msgstr "Tipke"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Continuous"
msgstr "Neprekinuto"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py pdfarranger_qt/viewer.py
msgid "One page at a time"
msgstr "Jedna stranica odjednom"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "scroll one line"
msgstr "pomakni za jedan redak"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "top of the previous / next page"
msgstr "vrh prethodne / sljedeće stranice"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "previous / next page"
msgstr "prethodna / sljedeća stranica"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "scroll one screen"
msgstr "pomakni za jedan zaslon"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "start / end of the document"
msgstr "početak / kraj dokumenta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "move the text cursor, by character or line"
msgstr "pomakni tekstni pokazivač, po znaku ili retku"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "extend the selection, by character or line"
msgstr "proširi odabir, po znaku ili retku"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "move the text cursor one word"
msgstr "pomakni tekstni pokazivač za jednu riječ"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "extend the selection one word"
msgstr "proširi odabir za jednu riječ"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "cursor to the start / end of the line"
msgstr "pokazivač na početak / kraj retka"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "cursor to the start / end of the document"
msgstr "pokazivač na početak / kraj dokumenta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Add Shift to a Command or Option combination to extend the selection instead"
" of moving — <b>Shift+Command+→</b> selects to the end of the line. Adding "
"Option works by the word rather than the character. On Windows and Linux, "
"read Command as Ctrl and Option as Alt; the table is the same everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Dodaj Shift kombinaciji s Commandom ili Optionom da proširiš odabir umjesto "
"da pomičeš — <b>Shift+Command+→</b> odabire do kraja retka. Dodavanje "
"Optiona radi po riječima umjesto po znakovima. Na Windowsima i Linuxu čitaj "
"Command kao Ctrl, a Option kao Alt; tablica je svugdje ista."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Selecting and copying text"
msgstr "Odabir i kopiranje teksta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag across the page to select text, across page boundaries if you keep "
"going. <b>Double-click</b> selects a word. <b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> copies, "
"<b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> selects the text of the page you are on, and <b>Esc</b> "
"clears the selection. The same commands are on the right-click menu."
msgstr ""
"Povuci preko stranice da odabereš tekst, preko granica stranica ako "
"nastaviš. <b>Dvoklik</b> odabire riječ. <b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> kopira, "
"<b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> odabire tekst stranice na kojoj si, a <b>Esc</b> briše "
"odabir. Iste su naredbe u izborniku desnog klika."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Shift+click</b> extends an existing selection to where you clicked. The "
"end you are moving grows out to a whole word, because a single click is an "
"imprecise way to point at one character; the end you started from stays "
"exactly where you put it. Dragging selects by character throughout, since "
"you can watch it and stop where you like."
msgstr ""
"<b>Shift+klik</b> proširuje postojeći odabir do mjesta na koje si kliknuo. "
"Kraj koji pomičeš raste do cijele riječi, jer je jedan klik neprecizan način"
" pokazivanja na jedan znak; kraj od kojeg si krenuo ostaje točno ondje gdje "
"si ga postavio. Povlačenje odabire po znakovima cijelo vrijeme, jer ga možeš"
" pratiti i stati gdje želiš."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Clicking on text leaves a blinking <b>text cursor</b>. That is what "
"Shift+arrow extends from, and what the Option and Command combinations above"
" move. It stays where you put it — scrolling, paging and clicking off the "
"page all leave it alone — until you press Esc or open another document."
msgstr ""
"Klik na tekst ostavlja treperavi <b>tekstni pokazivač</b>. Od njega "
"Shift+strelica proširuje odabir i njega pomiču gornje kombinacije s Optionom"
" i Commandom. Ostaje ondje gdje si ga postavio — pomicanje, listanje i klik "
"izvan stranice ne diraju ga — dok ne pritisneš Esc ili ne otvoriš drugi "
"dokument."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Following links"
msgstr "Slijeđenje poveznica"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Click a link to follow it. Links to a page in the same document jump there; "
"links to the web open in your browser. Hovering over one shows where it "
"goes, which is worth reading before you click: many links in a PDF are not "
"written by its author at all but inferred from the text, so what a link "
"points at is not always what the words appear to say."
msgstr ""
"Klikni poveznicu da je slijediš. Poveznice na stranicu istog dokumenta skaču"
" onamo; poveznice na web otvaraju se u tvom pregledniku. Zadržavanje "
"pokazivača nad poveznicom pokazuje kamo vodi, a to je vrijedno pročitati "
"prije klika: mnoge poveznice u PDF-u nije napisao autor nego su izvedene iz "
"teksta, pa ono na što poveznica pokazuje nije uvijek ono što riječi kao da "
"govore."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Only ordinary web and mail links are handed to the system — http, https, "
"mailto and ftp. A document is a file that arrived from somewhere, and "
"anything else it asks to open is refused and reported rather than acted on."
msgstr ""
"Sustavu se predaju samo obične web i poštanske poveznice — http, https, "
"mailto i ftp. Dokument je datoteka koja je odnekud došla, a sve drugo što "
"traži otvoriti odbija se i prijavljuje umjesto da se izvrši."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Right-clicking a link offers <b>Open Link</b> and <b>Copy Link Address</b>."
msgstr ""
"Desni klik na poveznicu nudi <b>Otvori poveznicu</b> i <b>Kopiraj adresu "
"poveznice</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Zabilješke"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The sidebar shows the document's bookmarks. Click one to jump to it. "
"Everything below is on the sidebar's right-click menu, and every command can"
" be undone."
msgstr ""
"Bočna ploča prikazuje zabilješke dokumenta. Klikni jednu da skočiš na nju. "
"Sve niže nalazi se u izborniku desnog klika bočne ploče, a svaka se naredba "
"može poništiti."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Add Bookmark Here</b> makes one pointing at the page you are reading, "
"named after whatever text you have selected — so select a heading, then add."
" With nothing selected it is named after the page. <b>Add Child Bookmark "
"Here</b> does the same, nested under the entry you clicked."
msgstr ""
"<b>Dodaj zabilješku ovdje</b> stvara zabilješku koja pokazuje na stranicu "
"koju čitaš, nazvanu prema tekstu koji si odabrao — dakle odaberi naslov pa "
"dodaj. Bez odabira naziva se prema stranici. <b>Dodaj podzabilješku "
"ovdje</b> čini isto, ugniježđeno pod stavkom na koju si kliknuo."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Rename</b> edits the title in place. <b>Re-home to This Page</b> points "
"an existing bookmark at the page you are on, keeping its title. "
"<b>Delete</b> removes an entry and <i>promotes</i> its children into its "
"place; <b>Delete with Children</b> removes the whole branch."
msgstr ""
"<b>Preimenuj</b> uređuje naslov na mjestu. <b>Preusmjeri na ovu stranicu</b>"
" tjera postojeću zabilješku da pokazuje na stranicu na kojoj si, uz zadržan "
"naslov. <b>Izbriši</b> uklanja stavku i <i>podiže</i> njezine podstavke na "
"njezino mjesto; <b>Izbriši s podstavkama</b> uklanja cijelu granu."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag entries within the sidebar to re-nest or reorder them. <b>Expand All "
"Children</b> and <b>Collapse All Children</b> open or shut a whole branch at"
" once."
msgstr ""
"Povlači stavke unutar bočne ploče da ih drugačije ugnijezdiš ili presložiš. "
"<b>Rasklopi sve podstavke</b> i <b>Sklopi sve podstavke</b> otvaraju ili "
"zatvaraju cijelu granu odjednom."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Style</b> sets a bookmark bold or italic, or gives it a colour, as the "
"tree shows."
msgstr ""
"<b>Stil</b> postavlja zabilješku podebljano ili u kurziv, ili joj daje boju,"
" kako stablo pokazuje."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"A bookmark whose page has been deleted is <b>greyed out</b> rather than "
"removed: its title may still be worth keeping, and you can point it "
"somewhere else with Re-home. Undoing the deletion reconnects it. <b>Delete "
"Dangling Bookmarks</b> clears them all out; it leaves alone any entry that "
"points nowhere on purpose, which is a legitimate way to write a heading."
msgstr ""
"Zabilješka čija je stranica izbrisana <b>posivi</b> umjesto da bude "
"uklonjena: njezin naslov može i dalje biti vrijedan čuvanja, a možeš je "
"preusmjeriti drugamo. Poništavanje brisanja ponovno je povezuje. <b>Izbriši "
"viseće zabilješke</b> uklanja ih sve; ostavlja na miru svaku stavku koja "
"namjerno ne pokazuje nikamo, što je posve legitiman način pisanja naslova."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Bookmark edits are part of the document and are written when you save, along"
" with each entry's colour and style and which branches are left open. The "
"one thing that cannot be saved is a bookmark with no page: there is no way "
"to record “points at a page that is gone”, so it comes back as a heading "
"with its title intact."
msgstr ""
"Izmjene zabilješki dio su dokumenta i zapisuju se pri spremanju, zajedno s "
"bojom i stilom svake stavke te s time koje grane ostaju otvorene. Jedino što"
" se ne može spremiti jest zabilješka bez stranice: ne postoji način da se "
"zapiše „pokazuje na stranicu koje više nema”, pa se vraća kao naslov s "
"netaknutim nazivom."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Arranging pages"
msgstr "Slaganje stranica"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages to reorder them. Hold <b>Ctrl</b> while dropping to copy instead "
"of move."
msgstr ""
"Povlači stranice da im promijeniš redoslijed. Drži <b>Ctrl</b> pri puštanju "
"da kopiraš umjesto da premjestiš."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages onto another window of the application to copy them there, or use"
" ordinary copy and paste."
msgstr ""
"Povuci stranice na drugi prozor programa da ih ondje kopiraš, ili upotrijebi"
" obično kopiranje i umetanje."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Paste As Odd/Even Pages</b> interleaves the clipboard with the document —"
" this is how two single-sided scans of a double-sided original are "
"recombined. If the second scan came off a duplex feeder it will be in "
"reverse order; use <b>Arrange ▸ Reverse Order</b> on it first."
msgstr ""
"<b>Umetni kao neparne/parne stranice</b> isprepliće međuspremnik s "
"dokumentom — tako se ponovno spajaju dva jednostrana skena dvostranog "
"izvornika. Ako je drugi sken izašao iz obostranog ulagača, bit će u obrnutom"
" redoslijedu; primijeni na njega prvo <b>Složi ▸ Obrni redoslijed</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"To move pages a long way, use <b>Move to Start</b>, <b>Move to End</b> or "
"<b>Move to Page…</b> rather than dragging — in a long document the far end "
"is a great deal of scrolling away. They are on the Edit menu and on the "
"right-click menu, and <b>Move to Page…</b> asks for the number the page "
"should <i>become</i>."
msgstr ""
"Da premjestiš stranice daleko, upotrijebi <b>Premjesti na početak</b>, "
"<b>Premjesti na kraj</b> ili <b>Premjesti na stranicu…</b> umjesto "
"povlačenja — u dugom je dokumentu drugi kraj vrlo daleko. Nalaze se u "
"izborniku Uredi i u izborniku desnog klika, a <b>Premjesti na stranicu…</b> "
"pita za broj kojim stranica treba <i>postati</i>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Prefer these to cut and paste for moving. A pasted page is a <i>new</i> page"
" as far as the document is concerned, so any bookmarks pointing at the "
"original are left behind with nowhere to go. Moving keeps the page itself, "
"and its bookmarks come with it."
msgstr ""
"Pri premještanju im daj prednost pred izrezivanjem i umetanjem. Umetnuta je "
"stranica iz perspektive dokumenta <i>nova</i> stranica, pa zabilješke koje "
"su pokazivale na izvornu ostaju bez odredišta. Premještanje čuva samu "
"stranicu, a njezine zabilješke idu s njom."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Stamping and tiling"
msgstr "Žigosanje i slaganje"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Page ▸ Add Page Numbers…</b> and <b>Page ▸ Add Watermark…</b> draw text "
"onto the selected pages. Both add a <i>layer</i> rather than rewriting the "
"page, so both can be undone and neither touches the file you opened."
msgstr ""
"<b>Stranica ▸ Dodaj brojeve stranica…</b> i <b>Stranica ▸ Dodaj vodeni "
"žig…</b> crtaju tekst na odabranim stranicama. Oboje dodaje <i>sloj</i> "
"umjesto da prepisuje stranicu, pa se oboje može poništiti i nijedno ne dira "
"datoteku koju si otvorio."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Page numbers follow the arrangement, not the source document: they are "
"numbered in the order the pages are in now. <code>{n}</code> in the format "
"is the page number and <code>{total}</code> the number of pages, so "
"<code>Page {n} of {total}</code> does what it looks like."
msgstr ""
"Brojevi stranica prate raspored, a ne izvorni dokument: numeriraju se onim "
"redom kojim su stranice sada. <code>{n}</code> u formatu je broj stranice, a"
" <code>{total}</code> broj stranica, pa <code>Stranica {n} od {total}</code>"
" radi ono na što izgleda."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrange ▸ Pages per Sheet…</b> tiles several pages onto one, in reading "
"order — the printer's <i>N-up</i>. The sheet turns sideways when that lets "
"the pages come out larger, which is why two-up gives a landscape sheet and "
"four-up does not."
msgstr ""
"<b>Složi ▸ Stranica po listu…</b> slaže više stranica na jednu, redoslijedom"
" čitanja — tiskarski <i>N-up</i>. List se okreće poprijeko kad stranice tako"
" ispadnu veće, i zato dvije po listu daju položeni list, a četiri po listu "
"ne."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Saving a document"
msgstr "Spremanje dokumenta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Optimize for the web</b> in Preferences lays the saved file out so a "
"browser can show the first page before the rest has arrived. <b>Compress</b>"
" repacks its streams and objects; how much that saves depends entirely on "
"the file, and one full of photographs will barely move."
msgstr ""
"<b>Optimiraj za web</b> u Postavkama slaže spremljenu datoteku tako da "
"preglednik može prikazati prvu stranicu prije nego ostatak stigne. "
"<b>Komprimiraj</b> ponovo pakira njezine tokove i objekte; koliko se time "
"uštedi ovisi isključivo o datoteci, a datoteka puna fotografija jedva se "
"pomakne."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Remove All Metadata</b> is a switch, like Password: turn it on and"
" the next save writes a document with no title, no author and no record of "
"what produced it. Edit Properties greys out while it is on, because there "
"would be nothing to edit."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Ukloni sve metapodatke</b> je prekidač, baš kao i Lozinka: "
"uključi ga i sljedeće spremanje zapisuje dokument bez naslova, bez autora i "
"bez traga o tome što ga je izradilo. Uredi svojstva posivi dok je uključen, "
"jer tada ne bi bilo što uređivati."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Viewer Preferences…</b> is how the saved document asks a reader to"
" open it — with the bookmarks showing, two pages at a time, and so on. "
"Readers are free to ignore all of it. The settings are read from the file "
"you opened, so a document that already had them keeps them."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Postavke preglednika…</b> način je na koji spremljeni dokument"
" moli čitatelja da ga otvori — s vidljivim zabilješkama, po dvije stranice "
"odjednom, i tako dalje. Čitatelji sve to slobodno mogu zanemariti. Postavke "
"se čitaju iz datoteke koju si otvorio, pa dokument koji ih je već imao "
"zadržava ih."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Repair Document…</b> rebuilds a damaged PDF. It works on a file "
"you pick rather than the one on screen, because the file worth repairing is "
"usually one this application cannot open properly either. It reports what it"
" found before writing anything."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Popravi dokument…</b> obnavlja oštećeni PDF. Radi na datoteci "
"koju odabereš, a ne na onoj na zaslonu, jer je datoteka vrijedna popravka "
"obično ona koju ni ovaj program ne otvara kako treba. Prije nego išta "
"zapiše, javlja što je pronašao."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "Miš"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Ctrl + scroll</b> — zoom"
msgstr "<b>Ctrl + kotačić</b> — zumiranje"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Shift + scroll</b> — scroll sideways"
msgstr "<b>Shift + kotačić</b> — pomicanje ustranu"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Alt + scroll</b> — scroll exactly one row"
msgstr "<b>Alt + kotačić</b> — pomicanje točno za jedan red"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Double-click</b> — fit the page to the window, and back"
msgstr "<b>Dvoklik</b> — prilagodi stranicu prozoru, i natrag"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Click and drag</b> on empty space — rubber-band select; keep scrolling to"
" extend it"
msgstr ""
"<b>Klikni i povuci</b> po praznom prostoru — odabir gumicom; nastavi "
"pomicati da ga proširiš"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around the grid"
msgstr "Kretanje po mreži"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrow keys</b> move between pages, <b>Page Up</b> and <b>Page Down</b> "
"move a screenful at a time, and <b>Home</b> and <b>End</b> jump to the first"
" and last page. Hold <b>Shift</b> with any of them to extend the selection."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tipke sa strelicama</b> pomiču se između stranica, <b>Page Up</b> i "
"<b>Page Down</b> za cijeli zaslon, a <b>Home</b> i <b>End</b> skaču na prvu "
"i posljednju stranicu. Drži <b>Shift</b> uz bilo koju od njih da proširiš "
"odabir."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Fit One Page</b> (F) scales so a whole page fits in the window and shows "
"one page per row — use it to work on a single page at a time. <b>Fit "
"Multiple Pages</b> (Shift+M) uses the same scale but lets as many pages sit "
"side by side as the window takes. <b>Fit Width</b> (Shift+F) fills the "
"window across instead, which shows the page wider but taller than the "
"window. Double-clicking the grid toggles Fit One Page on and off."
msgstr ""
"<b>Prilagodi jednu stranicu</b> (F) skalira tako da cijela stranica stane u "
"prozor i prikazuje jednu stranicu po redu — upotrijebi to kad radiš na "
"jednoj stranici. <b>Prilagodi više stranica</b> (Shift+M) koristi istu "
"skalu, ali pušta uz bok toliko stranica koliko prozor primi. <b>Prilagodi "
"širini</b> (Shift+F) umjesto toga popunjava prozor po širini, čime je "
"stranica šira, ali viša od prozora. Dvoklik po mreži uključuje i isključuje "
"Prilagodi jednu stranicu."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"With pages selected, all three fit the selection rather than the whole "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Kad su stranice odabrane, sve tri prilagođavaju odabir umjesto cijelog "
"dokumenta."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Finding text"
msgstr "Pronalaženje teksta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Find</b> selects the pages that contain the phrase and boxes each hit on "
"the thumbnail, so you can see where on the page it is. The boxes clear as "
"soon as you change the document, since the pages they were drawn for may "
"have moved."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pronađi</b> odabire stranice koje sadrže izraz i uokviruje svaki pogodak "
"na sličici, da vidiš gdje je na stranici. Okviri nestaju čim promijeniš "
"dokument, jer su se stranice za koje su nacrtani možda pomaknule."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Every shortcut can be changed in <b>Edit ▸ Preferences ▸ Keyboard "
"shortcuts</b>, where they are listed under the menu each one belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Svaki se prečac može promijeniti u <b>Uredi ▸ Postavke ▸ Tipkovni "
"prečaci</b>, gdje su popisani pod izbornikom kojemu svaki pripada."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Passwords"
msgstr "Lozinke"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Opening an encrypted document asks for its password, which is remembered "
"until the document is closed."
msgstr ""
"Otvaranje šifriranog dokumenta traži njegovu lozinku, koja se pamti dok se "
"dokument ne zatvori."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Password</b> encrypts the document when it is next saved. It is a "
"switch: turn it on and you are asked for a password, turn it off and the "
"next save is unencrypted. The password is never written to your settings, so"
" it applies to this session only — and if you forget it, the file cannot be "
"recovered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Lozinka</b> šifrira dokument pri sljedećem spremanju. To je "
"prekidač: uključi ga i bit ćeš upitan za lozinku, isključi ga i sljedeće "
"spremanje bit će nešifrirano. Lozinka se nikada ne zapisuje u tvoje "
"postavke, pa vrijedi samo za ovu sesiju — a ako je zaboraviš, datoteka se ne"
" može vratiti."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Unlock</b> goes the other way: open the document with its "
"password, choose Unlock, and the next save writes it without one. It is only"
" available when there is encryption to remove."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Otključaj</b> ide u drugom smjeru: otvori dokument njegovom "
"lozinkom, odaberi Otključaj i sljedeće spremanje zapisuje ga bez nje. "
"Dostupno samo kad ima šifriranja za uklanjanje."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Datoteke"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Settings are stored by Qt in the per-user location for this platform; on "
"Windows that is the registry under "
"<code>HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\pdfarranger</code>. There is no "
"configuration file to edit by hand."
msgstr ""
"Postavke Qt sprema na mjesto namijenjeno pojedinom korisniku na ovoj "
"platformi; na Windowsima je to registar pod "
"<code>HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\pdfarranger</code>. Ne postoji "
"konfiguracijska datoteka koja bi se uređivala ručno."

